From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tomer Vaknin <tomer@tec.org.il>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 18:06:26 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 6/6] feat(web): show context usage as a segmented meter in the
 stats line

The composer stats line reported context as a bare "6% context", which gives
no sense of how close the window is to full without reading the number. Show a
sixteen-block meter between the label and the percentage instead, lit from the
same compaction pressure the percentage colour already uses, so window pressure
reads at a glance.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
